  "uncertainty_scope": "Independent Peritheos staged refit of Hirose (2008) and Fei (2004) Au-MgO measurements. All 47 pressure targets are recalculated with the published, author-confirmed Speziale (2001) variable-q Debye EOS. Nine 300 K Hirose rows determine K0-prime with V0=67.85 A^3 and K0=167 GPa fixed; K0-prime is then fixed while 26 Fei and 12 hot Hirose rows determine beta1,beta2,beta3 and the logarithmic Kprime coefficient. Ambient expansivity remains source-fixed. Equal pressure-residual weights are an analyst choice. This is not a Hirose/Fei author fit or a Fei EOS refit. Stage-conditional curvature widths/covariance are archived only; catalog parameter errors remain unset because predictor, calibrant, fixed-anchor and inter-stage uncertainty/covariance are not propagated. Numerical reproducibility does not establish absolute pressure accuracy or independent predictive validity.",
